# Windows batch files are parsed by cmd.exe, which is fragile with LF-only line
# endings (a REM comment containing non-ASCII text was enough to make gui.bat
# misparse two lines into bogus commands). Force real CRLF on checkout no
# matter what the cloning machine's core.autocrlf is set to.
*.bat text eol=crlf
*.vbs text eol=crlf
